\subsection*{1.2.2 Commutativity}
(i) Whole numbers

Recall the commutativity of different operations for whole numbers by filling the following table.

\begin{tabular}{|l|l|l|}
\hline Operation & Numbers & Remarks \\
\hline Addition & \[\begin{aligned}
