\[\begin{aligned}
\text { Principal } & =₹ 21,000 \\
\text { Reduction } & =5 \% \text { of ₹ } 21000 \text { per year } \\
& =₹ \frac{21000 \times 5 \times 1}{100}=₹ 1050
\end{aligned}\]
value at the end of 1 year \(=₹ 21000-₹ 1050=₹ 19,950\)
